# Staff of the Storyteller puts a story counter on itself "whenever you create one or more creature tokens" (CR 111.2,
# 603.2c): its own Spirit on turn 1 makes the first. Bot2's Lingering Souls creating two Spirits on turn 2 adds nothing (not
# "you"), and neither does Bot1's Fanatical Offering making a Map token on turn 3, which is not a creature. Its ability
# ({W}, {T}, remove a counter: draw) is used on turn 3: the counter is gone and a card drawn; with the Staff tapped and no
# counter it cannot be used again (refused).

